-- One ask_aar_snapshots row for ASK 585 (the 41147 fault: on an n8n retry of a crashed execution, Record Substitution was called with no parameters) and its ask_aar_builders row.
-- Every value is from the Wall post named in its source (read in full by W3 at 22:29 CST), from audit row 41068, or from md5sum by W3 on /mnt/project-files/ask585/w4/write/.
-- NOT ON THE SHARED FOLDER: a585_w4/ (plan and build files) is in git only (commits b54dfa67, e92b9098); W3 did not md5 those files and takes their md5s from Wall 11275, 11278, 11280, 11282.
-- md5_written: 4a623df6, the Alternate Merge node code as written (Wall 11286 item 2; W1 readback Wall 11289 item 2 gives the full md5 4a623df613eeb41ffaee69208fa9617e). W1's grade at Wall 11278 item 1 names "patched 4a623df6" among the md5s it checked and item 3 is its own run of the test on that file; expected md5_match TRUE.
